CM_ "Only signals confirmed from a single 2011 W463 test vehicle are included. VIN, key ID, and odometer payloads are intentionally omitted.";
CM_ BO_ 0 "Measured: EZS_A1 ignition terminals (byte 0) and central-locking command pulses (bytes 3-5; byte 5 uses 0xAA for lock and 0x55 for unlock).";
CM_ BO_ 4 "Measured: Rear SAM (N10/2) broadcasts all four doorajar switches, tailgate switch, anti-theft alarm status, and rear bulb fault bitmask.";
CM_ BO_ 10 "Measured: Front SAM (N10/1) broadcasts exterior lighting states, alternator D+ (KL61), fluid/pad warnings, and front bulb fault bitmask.";
CM_ BO_ 68 "Measured: Physical driver-master stimuli confirmed these six manual request bits at about 51 Hz while held. No 0x044 command is sent for the driver's own front-left window.";
CM_ SG_ 24 FrontLeftWindowPositionRaw "Measured: 12-bit signed two's-complement Hall counter (down increases, up decreases; wraps modulo 4096).";
CM_ SG_ 25 FrontRightWindowPositionRaw "Measured: 12-bit signed two's-complement Hall counter (down increases, up decreases; wraps modulo 4096).";
CM_ SG_ 154 RearLeftWindowPositionRaw "Measured: 12-bit signed two's-complement Hall counter (down increases, up decreases; wraps modulo 4096).";
CM_ SG_ 156 RearRightWindowPositionRaw "Measured: 12-bit signed two's-complement Hall counter (down increases, up decreases; wraps modulo 4096).";
CM_ SG_ 2 EngineCoolantTemperature "Measured: Exact gateway copy of CAN-C 0x608 byte 0; raw encoding is degrees C plus 40.";
CM_ SG_ 826 GpsSpeed "Measured: AGW GPS_A3 ground speed, (raw - 0x8000) cm/s, signed.";
